{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 13, :comments ["<b>And it shall go up.</b> Upon her palaces — each of the sirim, and they are thorns, as in כי כקול הסירים תחת הסיר (Ecclesiastes 7:6). And likewise קמוש:" "<b>Tannim.</b> Like אח הייתי לתנים (Job 30:29):" "<b>Ḥatzir.</b> Like חצר (Exodus 27:12), and similarly ישיש (Job 15:10) and זקן וישש (II Chronicles 36:17):"], :book :isaiah, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 34, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Isaiah, by M. Friedlander; Society of Hebrew Literature, London 1877" "https://www.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH001338443"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:56:41.174998287Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}